written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hobby", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an activity you do out of personal interest", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Regardless of what kind of person you are, there is definitely a hobby or activity for you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about hobbies.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "canoeing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "traveling over water in a canoe (narrow wooden boat)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you prefer staying closer to the ground, rafting or canoeing might be more your speed.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mountain climbing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "going up a rock surface for fun and exercise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Some hobbies like mountain climbing take a lot of skill and practice.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bridge", "type": "name"}, {"content": "card game involving four players", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Certainly, a safer option is playing a game of bridge. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "card game", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a game played with a deck of playing cards divided into four suits ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Bridge is a very popular card game around the world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "indoors", "type": "name"}, {"content": "inside a building", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can play card games indoors.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "outdoors", "type": "name"}, {"content": "outside a building", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Let's stay outdoors. Let's go mountain climbing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hang gliding", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an activity in which you move through the air hanging from a flying device", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you're the adventurous type, you will probably enjoy the thrill of hang gliding or parachuting. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Frequency", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Adverbs of frequency (always, usually, never, etc.) say how often something happens.<br><br>Sometimes the adverb specifies the exact frequency of the action, like <span class=\"italic\">yearly</span> or <span class=\"italic\">daily</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "They are usually placed before the verb. With verb tenses that have two parts, like the Present Continuous tense, they are placed between the auxiliary and the main verb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How often?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"always\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"100%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"often\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"80%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"usually\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"60%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rarely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"10%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"never\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"0%\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "People are always finding interesting things to do in their free time. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There is never a dull moment when you have so many options to choose from.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use adverbs of manner to describe how something is done. <br>Example: She walked slowly. <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;How did she walk? Slowly.<br /><br />Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"strong\">-ly</span> to an adjective:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:    \tsad  \tsadly           \tcurious        \tcuriously", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You take out the letter -y and add <span class=\"strong\">-ily</span> to adjectives ending in -y.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: angry    angrily", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The adjectives <span class=\"strong\">fast, hard, well</span> and <span class=\"strong\">straight</span> are exceptions.  They do not change when they become adverbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Some adverbs, like <span class=\"italic\">basically</span> or <span class=\"italic\">generally</span>, are often placed at the beginning  of the sentence. You use a comma after the adverb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"definite <br>apparent<br>\\t\\t enthusiastic<br> apparent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"definitely<br> apparently<br> enthusiastically<br> apparently\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "There is definitely a hobby or activity for you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Apparently, these mountain climbers make it look easy, but don't be fooled.", "type": "example"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Start your dialogue with greetings.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your friends ask your opinion about free time activities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give suggestions. Explain each suggestion. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Conclude the dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice reading your dialogue.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue of 8 - 10 lines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give suggestions for free time activities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I explain the activities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice the dialogue.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le17ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "People are always finding interesting things to do in their free time. Regardless of what kind of person you are, there is definitely a hobby or activity for you, either indoors or outdoors.<br><br>If you're the adventurous type, you will probably enjoy the thrill of hang gliding or parachuting. If you prefer staying closer to the ground, canoeing will likely be more your speed.", "time": "", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "Some hobbies like mountain climbing take a lot of skill and practice. Each year, thousands of people enthusiastically prepare for new climbing opportunities. Apparently, these mountain climbers make it look easy, but don't be fooled. Mountain climbing can often be quite dangerous.", "time": "", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "text": "Certainly, a safer option is playing games. Bridge is a very popular card game around the world, and chess has been played for thousands of years.<br><br>With all these interesting hobbies it can be hard to choose what to do. There is never a dull moment when you have so many options to choose from. Even harder is finding the free time for them!", "time": "", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 2}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn6le17ob07re2vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "People are always finding interesting things to do in their free time. Regardless of what kind of person you are, there is definitely a hobby or activity for you, either indoors or outdoors.<br><br>If you're the adventurous type, you will probably enjoy the thrill of hang gliding or parachuting. If you prefer staying closer to the ground, canoeing will likely be more your speed.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "Some hobbies like mountain climbing take 